  "bodyHash": "ivgIzgQdTEg=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">这是一个针对 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a> 的扩展模组，使其能够与（类人）生物兼容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">需要 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-player-animator\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mob Player Animator</a> 通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\">Player Animator</a> 来正确动画化生物。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">包含配置选项，用于控制哪些生物可以使用 Better Combat 系统，同时自动黑名单化使用 GeckoLib 动画的生物，因为它们与 Player Animator 不兼容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">它与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guard Villagers</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Recruits</a> 兼容。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
